<title>USA: First Industrial Realty to offer 5 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>First Industrial Realty to offer 5 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Industrial Realty Trust Inc said Friday it was offering five million shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette Securities Corp is acting as the lead underwriter for the offering.</p>
<p>First Industrial, which made the announcement after the close of the New York trading session, has about 24.1 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>The stock closed 1/4 higher at 25-1/2.</p>
</text>
